The date reports merged into #4471 do not describe one bug. Tenant locale, booking-form
version, and channel separate them into two causes. The table below deduplicates overlapping
export rows by report ID, then classifies each report from its tenant and submission path.

## Cause breakdown

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

The shared parser reads month first, but day-first tenants expect day first. A separate form
problem affects day-first tenants using booking-v3: its `MM/DD/YYYY` hint conflicts with their
day-first date handling. Intake tags describe the initial guess, not the cause, so they are
shown for comparison rather than used to group reports.

The desk's one-day-move notes (R-41202, R-41209, R-41236, R-41344, and R-41620) are evidence
within the parser group, not a third cause.

